<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Prilla Treasures"
  description="Privacy information for Prissy Toddler Tools by Prilla Treasures."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated 11 September 2026</p>
  </header>

  <article class="content-shell article-body">
    <h2>Who is responsible for this website</h2>
    <p>Prissy Toddler Tools is a store within Prilla Treasures. The website address is PrillaTreasures.com. Privacy questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:founder@prillatreasures.com">founder@prillatreasures.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
    <p>You may provide an email address when joining an email list, downloading a free tool, making a purchase or contacting the founder. A contact email may also include the name and message you choose to send.</p>

    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>Checkout, payment, tax, fraud checks, receipts and digital file delivery are handled by Lemon Squeezy, which acts as the merchant of record. This website does not receive or store full payment card numbers. Lemon Squeezy processes the information needed to complete and support an order under its own privacy terms.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>A free product or purchase may require an email address so Lemon Squeezy can send the receipt and secure access instructions. This website does not currently operate a separate newsletter sign up form. If one is added later, this policy will be updated before it is used.</p>

    <h2>Website measurement</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare hosts and protects this website and may process basic technical information needed for security, delivery and website measurement, such as the page requested, approximate location, device information and traffic source. The website does not use its own advertising tracker or customer profiling system.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This shop is for adults buying or using resources for children. The website does not knowingly ask children to create accounts or submit personal information.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask what personal information is held, request a correction or ask for deletion when the law permits it. Send the request to <a href="mailto:founder@prillatreasures.com">founder@prillatreasures.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Other services</h2>
    <p>For information held by <a href="https://www.lemonsqueezy.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Lemon Squeezy</a> or <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare</a>, their own privacy policies and legal processes also apply. These links take you away from this website.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
